    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/bc_inline_ornament_03.png?t=1723742049\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/80e47f99cf8fb5feff956121d77f4d3f.webp?t=1723742049\" width=621 height=44 /></span><br>Black Castle is a story-rich dark fantasy adventure that mixes point &amp; click riddles with turn-based puzzles. Solve riddles and explore the castle\u2019s secrets. Master turn-based puzzles to progress through the depths of the castle.<br><br>Deep in the <strong>Black Forest</strong> lies the storied <strong>Black Castle</strong>. A darkness has taken over. Play as Silva, a young student turned adventurer and embark on a quest to rescue your sister Thea.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/9f2b41343711b922e91848885b473de0.poster.avif?t=1723742049\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/9f2b41343711b922e91848885b473de0.webm?t=1723742049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/9f2b41343711b922e91848885b473de0.mp4?t=1723742049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/bc_inline_ornament_03.png?t=1723742049\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/3f23963b5ada656830e78adf079a6d95.webp?t=1723742049\" width=621 height=44 /></span><br>An ancient bloodline. Dormant powers. A secret calling that must be fulfilled.<br><br>Uncover a world of <strong>medieval horror and witchcraft </strong>with its <strong>ghostly inhabitants</strong>. Unravel the unsettling truth of your heritage. But beware! Dangers await and above all, the terrifying Dark Lord seems to loom. <strong>Will you save your sister and help the castle\u2019s inhabitants along the way?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/a68e53b3a79bf59f531245d7ca7a0df7.poster.avif?t=1723742049\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/a68e53b3a79bf59f531245d7ca7a0df7.webm?t=1723742049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/a68e53b3a79bf59f531245d7ca7a0df7.mp4?t=1723742049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/bc_inline_ornament_03.png?t=1723742049\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/6b24a825897d5a7ba0052bb0ffdedc20.webp?t=1723742049\" width=621 height=44 /></span><br><strong>Defeat haunting enemies, maneuver through dangerous obstacles and dodge lethal traps. </strong> Visit 30 dioramic puzzle rooms, find hidden objects and discover hints to shine a light on the castle\u2019s gruesome past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827710/extras/0faf4a5b0c7f1ca52ad4707e64c3e8be.poster.avif?t=1723742049\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c